    <section id="waterfall" class="article-section article-section-wide">
      <div class="article-heading">
        <span>05.1 · one real system shape</span>
        <h2>See the thinking, the tools, and the effect in one view.</h2>
        <p>This CSS rendering follows the shape of a v0.4.0 OpenObserve trace: a gateway message wraps one session, several model turns, and two narrow broker calls. Blue spans are orchestration and model work. Green spans are broker-owned authority and I/O.</p>
      </div>

