      <div class="waterfall-reading">
        <article><span>01</span><h3>The message is the root</h3><p><code>gateway.message</code> measures one inbound chat message through reply delivery.</p></article>
        <article><span>02</span><h3>Model turns dominate</h3><p>Long blue bars make inference latency visible instead of blaming the provider or broker.</p></article>
        <article><span>03</span><h3>Scripts explain intent</h3><p>Each <code>prompt.script</code> contains ordered <code>shell.command</code> spans without argument values.</p></article>
        <article><span>04</span><h3>Effects have a narrow branch</h3><p>Authorization, execution, provider, and HTTP spans nest only where a command crosses the broker boundary.</p></article>
      </div>
